      "md": "## The fox stops early\n\nThe loop was written as `i <= 2` when the author meant three steps from 0, or `i < 2` when they needed three. Off-by-one is a counting story, not a mystery.\n\nFix the loop so the fox stands on the beacon at (3, 0)."
    },
